---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: output
---
sign_in_required: You're not signed in. Run `lk cloud login`.
person_required: This needs a person signed in with `lk cloud login`; unset LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_TOKEN.
organization_not_found: Organization not found. Check `lk cloud org list`.
project_not_found: Project not found. Check `lk cloud project list`.
environment_not_found: Environment not found. Check `lk cloud env list`.
insufficient_role: Your role doesn't allow this. Ask an organization owner for access.
insufficient_scope: This token doesn't allow this. Use a token with the required scope.
stale_revision: Someone else changed this environment. Retry to read its current revision.
confirmation_mismatch: Confirmation didn't match. Pass the exact slug with --confirm.
production: Production cannot be deleted. Delete the project to remove it.
slug_taken: That slug is in use. Choose another slug.
name_taken: That name is in use. Choose another name.
already_member: That person is already a member. Use `lk cloud org set-role` to change their role.
last_owner: This is the last owner. Make another member an owner first.
token_too_strong: Your role cannot grant those scopes. Choose narrower scopes or ask an owner.
project_token: This token is bound to one project. Use an organization token for this operation.
invalid_email: That email address isn't valid. Check the address and retry.
invalid_name: That name isn't valid. Choose a nonempty name and retry.
invalid_slug: That slug isn't valid. Use 3 to 40 lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, starting with a letter.
invalid_detected: Detected targets or variable names aren't valid. Send names only and retry.
invalid_environment: That environment isn't valid. Use a staging or preview name and retry.
invalid_region: That region isn't valid. Check the cloud's available regions and retry.
invalid_scale: That scale isn't valid. Check minimum, maximum and sleep settings and retry.
invalid_lifetime: That token lifetime isn't valid. Use --expires 30, 90 or 365.
invalid_scopes: A token needs a scope. Pass --scope read, deploy, manage, publish, billing or admin.
invitation_invalid: That invitation is no longer valid. Ask an organization owner for a new invitation.
invitation_not_found: Invitation not found. Check `lk cloud org invitations`.
member_not_found: Member not found. Check `lk cloud org members`.
token_not_found: Token not found. Check `lk cloud token list`.
wrong_email: Sign in with the invitation's verified email address and retry.
too_many_invitations: This organization has too many pending invitations. Revoke an invitation and retry.
too_many_projects: This organization has reached its project limit. Delete an unused project and retry.
too_many_environments: This project has reached its environment limit. Delete an unused environment and retry.
token_name_taken: existing token ci; [redacted]
unknown_code: existing token ci; [redacted]
